{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國上周六（17日）的大規模暴力示威至周一仍有餘波：巴黎一批示威者今晨封鎖羅浮宮博物館入口，稱支持高中學生運動抗議諸多教育問題，以及譴責警方「鎮壓」示威者，導致羅浮宮未能如常開門。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:01.984650+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:44:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:17:37.795329+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:34.434089+00:00","content_hash":"3ff50d36b51ea5fb633449a96190511df0e80f16294072bdf0f7b7cdbe839cf8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}